"""ARCH-45 — Universal Document Corroborator & Discrepancy Matrix.
One atomic, idempotent apply for the whole milestone (backend, console, verifiers, deploy, docs).

Run from backend/:

    python apply_arch45.py --check      # report every file, write nothing
    python apply_arch45.py              # apply
    python apply_arch45.py              # again: every line reads "already applied"
    python apply_arch45.py --rollback   # restore what the last apply replaced
    python apply_arch45.py --list       # the files this script owns

Accepted starting point: 79f6277 ("ARCH-44 DONE"). A file already carrying a
later milestone's sentinel (ARCH46-S1: and on) is reported as superseded.

ARCH45-S1:apply. GENERATED from `git diff 79f6277` plus the new files
(38 new, 46 edited through 111 anchors); the generator refuses to
emit if any file carries no ARCH45-S sentinel, and every edit is an anchor that
occurs exactly once when it applies, checked against the final sha256.
"""

